            </note>
            <note corresp="#d150-f3" n="3" xml:id="d150-f3-content">
                <p>Concerning the Dumbarton Oaks conversations with respect to the establishment of
                    the United Nations, see Harley A. Notter, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Postwar Foreign Policy Preparation, 1989–1945</hi>
                    (Washington, Government Printing Office, 1949; Department of State publication
                    No. 3580), pp. 301–338.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d150-f4" n="4" xml:id="d150-f4-content">
                <p>The reference is to Vandenberg’s speech in
                    the Senate on January 10, 1945; see <hi rendition="#italic">Congressional
                        Record</hi>, vol. 91, pt. 1, pp. 164–167.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
